  "description": "Modal CRAFTsynth 2.0 monophonic synthesizer: every controller of its manual's MIDI CC implementation chart, with the values it prints.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "CRAFTsynth 2.0 User Manual v1.4",
      "notes": "MIDI CC implementation chart (pages 21, 22 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/modal/import-modal.mjs from CRAFTsynth_II_MANUAL_v1_4.pdf (sha256 f18d697ea9e209d1fe95d3c68aa493ad4fa3d55ff02acb6c59359dd3df1788c8), https://modalelectronics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/CRAFTsynth_II_MANUAL_v1_4.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/modal/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/modal/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI CC implementation chart, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The chart prints each controller's values: a range is the parameter's, bands and named values a choice (a band's first value sent), anything else 0 - 127 with the printed text in the description.",
    "Left out, the wheel, the pedals, the joystick, bank select, the NRPN controllers and the channel mode messages: CC 1 Modulation Wheel, CC 11 Expression Pedal, CC 64 Sustain Pedal, CC 120 All Sound Off, CC 121 Reset All Controllers, CC 123 All Notes Off, CC 124 Omni Off, CC 125 Omni On."
  ],
